  "ev.AD-210.body": "The recipe you practised as a teenager reminds you of home. With the town festival approaching, you think about passing it on.",
  "ev.AD-210.a": "Teach the recipe informally",
  "ev.AD-210.a.res": "You teach the recipe informally. You strengthen your caring side; you feel a little brighter; it takes 1 hour.",
