  "ev.SE-102.title": "Years of money decisions",
  "ev.SE-102.body": "You chose to try investing when you first planned a household budget. Looking at investments now, you remember that early decision.",
  "ev.SE-102.a": "Review your current tolerance",
  "ev.SE-102.a.res": "You review your current tolerance. You strengthen your cautious side; it feels a little disappointing; some tension eases.",
