  "ev.SE-102.c.res": "You pause and reflect first. Your mood dips slightly; some tension eases; you recover a little energy.",
  "ev.SE-103.title": "A lesson together",
  "ev.SE-103.body": "You once chose to help a child with schoolwork. Now your grandchild {other} is old enough to learn a skill from you.",
  "ev.SE-103.a": "Explain a familiar skill",
  "ev.SE-103.a.res": "You explain a familiar skill. You feel closer to {other}; you feel a little calmer, but you feel slightly tired.",
  "ev.SE-103.b": "Prepare written instructions",
