  "ev.SE-103.c": "Ask what interests them",
  "ev.SE-103.c.res": "You ask what interests them. You strengthen your caring side; you feel a little calmer, but you feel slightly tired.",
  "ev.SE-104.title": "Care comes around",
  "ev.SE-104.body": "You once coordinated care for an elderly parent. As {other} needs care now, you remember that helpers need support too.",
  "ev.SE-104.a": "Discuss manageable care tasks",
  "ev.SE-104.a.res": "You discuss manageable care tasks. You feel closer to {other}; some tension eases, but you feel slightly tired.",
  "ev.SE-104.b": "Prepare questions for relatives",
  "ev.SE-104.b.res": "You prepare questions for relatives. You strengthen your cautious side; your mood dips slightly; you feel a little calmer.",
  "ev.SE-104.c": "Set aside time to rest",
  "ev.SE-104.c.res": "You set aside time to rest. Your mood dips slightly; you feel refreshed.",
  "ev.SE-105.title": "The town's celebrations",
  "ev.SE-105.body": "You offered to volunteer at a festival years ago. During another town celebration, you think about how people make these days special.",
  "ev.SE-105.a": "Share a celebration memory",
  "ev.SE-105.a.res": "You share a celebration memory. You build your sociable side; there is a small lift in your mood, but you feel a little more tense.",
  "ev.SE-105.b": "Offer manageable practical help",
  "ev.SE-105.b.res": "You offer manageable practical help. Kindness becomes a stronger habit; you feel a little brighter, but it adds a little pressure.",
  "ev.SE-105.c": "Enjoy the occasion quietly",
  "ev.SE-105.c.res": "You enjoy the occasion quietly. Your mood lifts, but you feel a little more tense.",
  "ev.SE-106.title": "Making newcomers welcome",
  "ev.SE-106.body": "You remember offering a newcomer a tour of the town. A discussion about local services makes you consider how to welcome new residents today.",
  "ev.SE-106.a": "Suggest a welcome guide",
  "ev.SE-106.a.res": "You suggest a welcome guide. You strengthen your caring side; you feel a little brighter, but you feel a little more tense.",
  "ev.SE-106.b": "Describe confusing local services",
  "ev.SE-106.b.res": "You describe confusing local services. You strengthen your cautious side; you miss a little of the enjoyment; you feel a little calmer.",
  "ev.SE-106.c": "Listen to others' experiences",
  "ev.SE-106.c.res": "You listen to others' experiences. You practise connecting with others; some tension eases, but it takes a little energy.",
  "ev.SE-107.title": "Prepared for the rain",
  "ev.SE-107.body": "You once offered to help with storm recovery. While thinking about a community garden, you remember the importance of drainage and safe paths.",
  "ev.SE-107.a": "Suggest safer garden drainage",
  "ev.SE-107.a.res": "You suggest safer garden drainage. You strengthen your cautious side; you miss a little of the enjoyment; some tension eases.",
  "ev.SE-107.b": "Share lessons from storms",
  "ev.SE-107.b.res": "You share lessons from storms. Kindness becomes a stronger habit; there is a small lift in your mood, but you feel a little more tense.",
  "ev.SE-107.c": "Learn about resilient planting",
  "ev.SE-107.c.res": "You learn about resilient planting. You build a habit of learning; you feel a little calmer, but you feel slightly tired.",
  "ev.SE-108.title": "Now you are the elder",
  "ev.SE-108.body": "You asked older residents about the town's past. Today a history project gives you a reason to reflect on your own memories.",
  "ev.SE-108.a": "Outline your town memories",
  "ev.SE-108.a.res": "You outline your town memories. You build a habit of learning; there is a small lift in your mood; you feel a little more tense.",
  "ev.SE-108.b": "Tell someone a favourite story",
  "ev.SE-108.b.res": "You tell someone a favourite story. You build your sociable side; you feel a little calmer, but you feel slightly tired.",
  "ev.SE-108.c": "Offer to preserve a photograph",
  "ev.SE-108.c.res": "You offer to preserve a photograph. You strengthen your caring side; there is a small lift in your mood; you feel a little more tense.",
  "ev.SE-109.title": "The useful paper trail",
  "ev.SE-109.body": "You once chose to keep accurate records when blamed at work. Now that habit could help you organise your own important papers.",
  "ev.SE-109.a": "List important documents",
  "ev.SE-109.a.res": "You list important documents. You strengthen your cautious side; your mood dips slightly; some tension eases.",
